        "subject": "LU-6142 lov: Do not return negative from fiemap_calc_fm_end_offset",
        "message": "LU-6142 lov: Do not return negative from fiemap_calc_fm_end_offset\n\nFunction fiemap_calc_fm_end_offset returns unsigned value\nand check against stripe_no and negative is not required.\nThis check is not required as stripe_no is retunred by\nlov_stripe_number() and it cannot be negative\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nReported-by: (https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/63054)\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I708995e40aa31dce789c1d3e5428f01dcf9a5ca9\n"
      },
